# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of OS checkout
# settings, so Prettier/ESLint checks and diffs are consistent across
# contributors (Windows/macOS/Linux). Git still checks files out using the
# platform's native line endings unless core.autocrlf is overridden locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch line endings
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
